# Normalize to LF in the repository and on checkout.
#
# Without this, Git checks out LF files as CRLF on Windows while buf and the
# Go/TS plugins always write LF. `just gen-check` would then report drift on
# every run, and the same commit would differ between a Windows host and the
# Linux dev container.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
